  the WARDOGS Artillery Calculator project (MIT License,
  https://github.com/sugus888/wardogs-calculator)
- Weapon cycle hotkey and MIL lines on the HUD
- Thai user interface (default) alongside Chinese and English
- Renamed program, separate settings folder (%AppData%\SuMortar) and version scheme

